### Geometry

## ENTITY

Pivot, Geometry, Template

## NOTES

* [1]:
  YAML Ain't Markup Language - <http://yaml.org>
* [2]:
  Portable PixMap - <http://netpbm.sourceforge.net/doc/ppm.html>


## SEE ALSO
`solstice`(1)


